{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/339493-help-how-to-make-a-cipher","id":339493,"title":"Help: how to make a Cipher?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-13T15:40:54-08:00","id":339493,"title":"Help: how to make a Cipher?","content":"Hello, I really like the new Demon, but as game master will be my duty to create a cipher for all my players, mixing four Embeds, it's right? But how can I build up it? I still don't understand the mechanics behind it's creation. Someone can explain it to me?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2457,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","user":"Ipergigio","date":". 12-13-2014, 06:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-27T21:04:57-08:00","id":352302,"title":"","content":"Well, the Storyteller's guide to Demon is pledged to have all sorts of useful advice on this topic...<br /> <br /> The cipher is a guide-post, the first and only one a demon gets on the Descent. Each embed contributes a thematic element that individually provide the stages of an internal journey. Taken together they help the character answer questions that matter in a universe that does not care. &quot;Who am I? What do I want? Why am I here and where am I going&quot; The Final Secret does not provide an answer, it provides a direction.<br /> <br /> Review each character's aspirations, catalyst, and background details. Get the players to describe what kind of character arc they envision, at least initially. Make your players pick the initial Key. Ask them what their character is doing to find their way to Hell (there's no road map in the existing sources, so this question forces the players to make their own answer. Which is the point)<br /> <br /> The Final Truth should be like any good story twist: Inevitable and unexpected. You don't want to force a new direction on the character contrary to the the sort of story the player wants to tell, but you can shake them up and unsettle them with new revelations.<br /> <br /> Two my troupe has completed:<br /> <br /> Victory at any cost - Shatter - Cooler Heads Prevail - Inspiration: &quot;<i>Crack the shell, preserve the egg within</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> The completion this cipher marked the Guardian/Saboteur's transition from a barely-stable liability to a team player. The Final Truth provided affirmation that a world without the G-M was worth fighting for, but also warned that unrestrained destruction and callous violence would turn that world to ash. The player took the Multiple Agenda merit (Inquisitor) and changed his virtue to Precise to mark this new understanding.<br /> <br /> Special Message - Password Entropy - Authorized - Voice of the Machine: &quot;<i>It awaits your message</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> The Integrator/Messenger got this one: The final interlock will let her speak to the G-M, <u>and be understood</u>. I told the player that she would use this at the climax of the chronicle... and she should be thinking about what she's going to say if she wants the chronicle to end on a positive note. The look on her face as she realized the implications was... <i>perfect</i>.<br /> <br /> Hope that helps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2233,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","user":"Agentwestmer","date":". 01-08-2015, 08:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}